  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "装配（from 静态工厂）",
      "items": [
        "每个 AiPlatform 需非空 id；platform 字符串经 resolvePlatformType 映射 PlatformType，未知值抛 IllegalArgumentException",
        "createScopedConfiguration：BeanUtil.copyProperties 拷全局配置，再按平台 switch 写入 OpenAiConfig/DoubaoConfig 等子配置"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "每 id 一个 AiService",
      "items": [
        "AiServiceFactory.create(scopedConfiguration) 为每个平台 id 建独立 AiService；registrations 是不可变 LinkedHashMap",
        "一个进程可同时持有 openai-main、doubao-backup 等多个 id，各自独立 api-key/base-url"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "查找与兼容入口",
      "items": [
        "find(id) 命中 AiServiceRegistration 后取 AiService，再 getChatService(platformType) 走平台 switch 到具体实现",
        "FreeAiService 是 @Deprecated 兼容壳：构造时把 Registry.from 结果装进静态 registry，按 id 转发"
      ]
    }
